<title>SRI LANKA: Commercial up 2.6 pct on institutional buy.</title>
<headline>Commercial up 2.6 pct on institutional buy.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sri Lanka blue chip Commercial Bank Ltd rose 2.6 percent, or five rupees, to 200 on institutional buying in early Friday trade, brokers sid.</p>
<p>A broker said an institution was buying Commercial Bank shares in large volumes, but added that it was not immediately clear whether it was an overseas buy.</p>
<p>Brokers said 20,000 shares of Commercial Bank were still on bid at 200 rupees each.</p>
<p>Commercial Bank is one of four private banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
